962 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Joyce moved from Taiwan to Canada two years ago\056 Back home\054 she gained experience in plumbing through hands\055on apprenticeships\056 Since relocating\054 she has been working as an apprentice plumber while preparing for Canadian trade certification exams\056 While technically skilled\054 she struggles with English\054 especially trade\055specific terminology\054 pronunciation\054 and safety instructions\056 Joyce wants a tool that can help her quickly learn and recall technical vocabulary\054 understand pronunciation\054 and practice communicating with supervisors and clients\056 She values straightforward\054 practical learning without overwhelming lessons\056 She wants to feel confident at job sites and eventually grow into a full journeyman role\056)
